{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be a Cat. Cause Chaos. Nap Later.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of a mischievous house cat in this cozy chaos simulator. Choose your favorite breed and explore fully interactive environments where everything can be knocked over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Cat:</strong> Tuxedo, Black Cat, British Shorthair, Orange Cat, Siamese \u2014 and more to come!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Feline Freedom:</strong> Walk, run, jump, climb, and swipe with physics-based actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whirlwind Spin:</strong> Unleash a powerful spin attack to knock over everything around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Upgrades:</strong> Enhance your Whirlwind Spin \u2014 grow bigger, spin longer, and recharge faster for maximum chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Toy Friends:</strong> Discover and collect dozens of adorable plush toy companions \u2014 carry on back as you explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with Interactive Objects:</strong> Play with toys, scratch pads, or curl up to sleep in a cozy box between bursts of chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Environments:</strong> Cause chaos beyond the house \u2014 explore office, bookstore, and supermarket, each packed with unique toys and topple-able items.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3417940?t=1761754256","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3417940?t=1761754256","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/ef6746419adc8c3daf4a3336f29ec67390ba7304/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761754256","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite